 link for Crawlers --></a></span> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Points</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/High_Spirits_(Condition)\" title=\"High Spirits (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"High Spirits\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/High_Spirits_(Condition)\" title=\"High Spirits (Condition)\">High Spirits</a></dt>\n<dd>The amulet's spirit lingers, making everything seem a little more vibrant. Must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon now